{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304400","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530440001:1":{"text":"신도... 죽는다고요?","source_cn":"神……也会死？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA16322767BFA9419","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530440002:1":{"text":"아쿠보르인은 죽은 뒤에 신의 품으로 돌아가. 하지만 신은 죽으면 어디로 돌아가죠?","source_cn":"雅库伯尔人死去后，会进入神的怀抱。可是神死去后，又会前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B7F347A68FCAA5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530440003:1":{"text":"이건... 너무 이상해요! 상상이 안 가요!","source_cn":"这……这实在太奇怪了！我根本想象不到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F6EC603EF60F1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:玲":{"text":"링","source":"玲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}